{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t亞殘運輪椅劍擊女子A級花劍項目十六強，港隊代表余翠怡和林嘉雯晉級。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n賽事首號種子劍手余翠怡以15:3輕勝伊拉克代表入八強，林嘉雯以15:11擊敗泰國劍手，打入半準決賽。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n其他港隊劍手方面，范珮珊和鄧程程分別不敵國家隊代表，十六強止步。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：李俊傑\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T06:59:00.942137+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":124,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T06:46:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T07:17:41.245715+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T06:57:37.807808+00:00","content_hash":"7ad1b43f13e360af891b8855964f76b9537eb6ce72dc67e340e49fad4e04af43","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}